{"zh-CN":{"zh-CN:blog":[{"route":"/blog/opengles-transparent-video/","title":"OpenGLES开发透明通道视频备忘录","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Android","className":"vp-tag-color-17"},{"name":"OpenGLES","className":"vp-tag-color-15"}],"date":"2020-04-22","words":2063,"readingTime":{"words":"约 2063 字","time":"大约 7 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>最近在做带透明MP4视频的渲染播放，原理就是视频的一半是只有黑白颜色的透明通道，另一半则是视频原来的画面，只要利用OpenGLES在渲染时提取原来画面的对应位置上的透明通道的透明度，设置到原来画面的像素上，就可以达到播放透明视频的效果。</p>\n<p>原理很简单，实现也不难，但是中间遇到了一些坑，折腾了一段时间才弄明白，主要原因还是基础原理不了解，还是要多学习。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/logitech-unifying-linux/","title":"Linux下罗技优联鼠标的简略指北","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Linux","className":"vp-tag-color-2"},{"name":"罗技","className":"vp-tag-color-17"},{"name":"Logitch","className":"vp-tag-color-8"},{"name":"Logitch Options","className":"vp-tag-color-10"}],"date":"2020-03-16","words":735,"readingTime":{"words":"约 735 字","time":"大约 2 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>最近陪我征战10多年的IO1.1光(左)荣(键)退(双)休(击)了，想来修修补补用到现在，实在不容易。<s>如果微软出IO1.1复刻，我直接买爆。</s></p>\n<p>本来可以再修一下继续用，但是想来还是不折腾了，直接下单MX Master 3。不得不说，手感确实还可以，办公一流，但前提是可以用Logitch Options。那么问题来了，罗技并没有出基于Linux版本的Logitch Options……</p>\n<p>为了解决这个问题，我所找到的方案有：</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/setlayoutparams-onmeasure/","title":"setLayoutParams和onMeasure","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Android","className":"vp-tag-color-17"}],"date":"2020-02-16","words":205,"readingTime":{"words":"约 205 字","time":"小于 1 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/cpp-reference-pointer/","title":"C++中的&和*","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"C++","className":"vp-tag-color-5"}],"date":"2019-08-01","words":1325,"readingTime":{"words":"约 1325 字","time":"大约 4 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>关于C艹中的<code>&amp;</code>和<code>*</code>的作用，其实是比较基础的知识，但是一段时间不碰就要忘（记性不好），所以要做点笔记方便查找。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/cpp-typedef-pointer/","title":"C++中typedef和指针结合时理解","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"C++","className":"vp-tag-color-5"}],"date":"2019-05-11","words":513,"readingTime":{"words":"约 513 字","time":"大约 2 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/cpp-top-level-const/","title":"C++中的顶层const","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"C++","className":"vp-tag-color-5"}],"date":"2019-05-11","words":438,"readingTime":{"words":"约 438 字","time":"大约 1 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/cpp-memory-allocation/","title":"C++的内存分配","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"C++","className":"vp-tag-color-5"},{"name":"Java","className":"vp-tag-color-4"}],"date":"2019-05-10","words":953,"readingTime":{"words":"约 953 字","time":"大约 3 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/mediacodec-frame-rate/","title":"MediaCodec编码摄像头数据时控制帧率的方法","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Android","className":"vp-tag-color-17"},{"name":"MediaCodec","className":"vp-tag-color-14"},{"name":"OpenGLES","className":"vp-tag-color-15"}],"date":"2019-05-09","words":604,"readingTime":{"words":"约 604 字","time":"大约 2 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/modulo-vs-remainder/","title":"关于取模运算和取余运算","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[],"date":"2019-05-09","words":721,"readingTime":{"words":"约 721 字","time":"大约 2 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/rxjava-thread-issues/","title":"RxJava的一些线程问题","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Android","className":"vp-tag-color-17"},{"name":"RxJava","className":"vp-tag-color-4"}],"date":"2019-04-19","words":1237,"readingTime":{"words":"约 1237 字","time":"大约 4 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/flutter-introduction/","title":"Flutter先导篇","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Flutter","className":"vp-tag-color-0"}],"date":"2018-11-02","words":1061,"readingTime":{"words":"约 1061 字","time":"大约 4 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/recyclerview-itemanimator-bug/","title":"RecyclerView重写ItemAnimator导致的Bug","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Android","className":"vp-tag-color-17"}],"date":"2018-10-30","words":557,"readingTime":{"words":"约 557 字","time":"大约 2 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/dart-abc-8-concurrency/","title":"The ABC of Dart Part 8 - 并发","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Dart","className":"vp-tag-color-13"}],"date":"2018-08-31","words":5479,"readingTime":{"words":"约 5479 字","time":"大约 18 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>说到<code>Dart</code>中的并发，这里需要先介绍一下<code>Dart</code>中的异步机制，以下内容转自<a href=\"https://segmentfault.com/a/1190000008800122\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dart异步任务与消息循环机制</a></p>\n<p>翻译自<a href=\"https://www.dartlang.org/articles/event-loop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.dartlang.org/articles/event-loop/</a></p>\n<p>异步任务在Dart中随处可见，例如许多库的方法调用都会返回Future对象来实现异步处理，我们也可以注册Handler来响应一些事件，如：鼠标点击事件，I/O流结束和定时器到期。</p>\n<p>这篇文章主要介绍了Dart中与异步任务相关的消息循环机制，阅读完这篇文章后相信你可写出更赞的异步执行代码。你也能学习到如何调度Future任务并且预测他们的执行顺序。</p>\n<p>在阅读这篇文章之前，你最好先要了解一下基本的Future用法。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/dart-abc-7-async/","title":"The ABC of Dart Part 7 - 异步","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Dart","className":"vp-tag-color-13"}],"date":"2018-08-13","words":2985,"readingTime":{"words":"约 2985 字","time":"大约 10 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p><code>Dart</code>中没有线程这种概念，或者说对线程进行了包装，调用者无法对线程进行直接的操作。所以<code>Dart</code>为异步操作提供了一些对应的API和关键字，分别有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>async</code>和<code>await</code>关键字</li>\n<li><code>Async*</code>、<code>sync*</code>、<code>yield*</code>关键字和<code>Stream</code>的API</li>\n<li><code>Future</code>的API</li>\n</ul>\n<p>细分下来还是挺多内容的，尤其像<code>Stream</code>这种流式操作，网上相关的资料都叙述得不够详细。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/dart-abc-5-operator-overloading/","title":"The ABC of Dart Part 5 - 操作符重载","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Dart","className":"vp-tag-color-13"}],"date":"2018-08-03","words":151,"readingTime":{"words":"约 151 字","time":"小于 1 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p><code>Dart</code>可以像C语言一样重载部分操作符。支持重载的操作符有：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>&lt;</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>+</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>^</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>[]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>&gt;</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>/</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>&amp;</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>[]=</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>&lt;=</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>~/</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>&lt;&lt;</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>~</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>&gt;=</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>*</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>&gt;&gt;</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>==</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>-</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><code>%</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"},{"route":"/blog/dart-abc-6-library-imports/","title":"The ABC of Dart Part 6 - 库类的引用","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Dart","className":"vp-tag-color-13"}],"date":"2018-08-03","words":1419,"readingTime":{"words":"约 1419 字","time":"大约 5 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p><code>Dart</code>中除了最基本的类型对象外，还提供了很多不同功能的库或类，比如一些异步操作、IO操作等等，这些都被一一封装到<code>Dart</code>的SDK中，由一个个独立的.dart文件承载着。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/dart-abc-4-collections/","title":"The ABC of Dart Part 4 - 集合","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Dart","className":"vp-tag-color-13"}],"date":"2018-08-02","words":669,"readingTime":{"words":"约 669 字","time":"大约 2 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p><code>Dart</code>中提供的集合容器分别是我们常见的<code>List</code>、<code>Map</code>、<code>Set</code>，但它也只有这三种类型的集合，并不像其他语言会细分到<code>ArrayList</code>、<code>LinkedList</code>之类的。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/tween-animation-lifecycle/","title":"注意Tween Animation对Activity生命周期的影响","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Android","className":"vp-tag-color-17"}],"date":"2018-07-30","words":515,"readingTime":{"words":"约 515 字","time":"大约 2 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>最近遇到一个神奇的问题——一个<code>Activity</code>调用<code>finish()</code>后，该页面的<code>onStop()</code>和<code>onDestroy()</code>间隔大概十秒后才被调用。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/audiotrack-stutter/","title":"AudioTrack播放卡顿的现象","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[],"date":"2018-07-19","words":251,"readingTime":{"words":"约 251 字","time":"小于 1 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/dart-abc-3-classes/","title":"The ABC of Dart Part 3 - 类","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Dart","className":"vp-tag-color-13"}],"date":"2018-06-11","words":2187,"readingTime":{"words":"约 2187 字","time":"大约 7 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>前面说到<code>Dart</code>中一切皆为对象。而所有对象都是类的实例，并且所有类都为<code>Object</code>的子类。</p>\n<p>和其他语言一样，类也是用<code>class</code>关键字作为声明。</p>\n<div class=\"language-dart\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"dart\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"vp-copy-code-button\" data-copy-code data-copy-duration=\"2000\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" data-copied=\"已复制\"></button><pre class=\"vp-code shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\">class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\"> TestClass</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"indent\">  </span><span class=\"indent\"> </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div>"},{"route":"/blog/dart-abc-2-functions/","title":"The ABC of Dart Part 2 - 函数","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Dart","className":"vp-tag-color-13"}],"date":"2018-06-08","words":2246,"readingTime":{"words":"约 2246 字","time":"大约 7 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>函数的写法跟其他语言基本大同小异，如下：</p>\n<div class=\"language-dart\" data-highlighter=\"shiki\" data-ext=\"dart\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"vp-copy-code-button\" data-copy-code data-copy-duration=\"2000\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" data-copied=\"已复制\"></button><pre class=\"vp-code shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\"> func1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\">String</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> str</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"indent\">  </span><span class=\"indent\">  </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\">return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\"> int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">parse</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">str</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>在以上的函数<code>func1</code>中，声明了返回值为<code>int</code>类型的对象，函数参数为<code>String</code>，这是一种标准写法。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/dart-abc-1-basics/","title":"The ABC of Dart Part 1 - 基础","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Dart","className":"vp-tag-color-13"}],"date":"2018-06-07","words":1593,"readingTime":{"words":"约 1593 字","time":"大约 5 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>近期对<code>Flutter</code>有兴趣，但这个东西要用<code>Dart</code>来写应用，只能先入门一下这门语言。</p>\n<p>目前把基础看了一部分，总体而言，<code>Dart</code>和目前比较火热的<code>JavaScript</code>、<code>Kotlin</code>一样是一门脚本式语言，支持函数式编程，函数依然是第一公民，不过<code>Dart</code>对于对象的支持和定义更详细。另外，<code>Dart</code>运行在自己的<code>Dart VM</code>上，和其他的JVM语言不同，所以无论是使用<code>Flutter</code>或者是<code>Dart</code>，都需要先安装<code>Dart VM</code>。</p>\n<p>至于IDE，我用的Android Studio，安装上<code>Dart</code>插件即可。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/data-recommendation-victim/","title":"你可能是数据推荐的受害者","categories":[{"name":"骚灵","id":"badc57"}],"tags":[],"date":"2018-05-25","words":1344,"readingTime":{"words":"约 1344 字","time":"大约 4 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>如果你是一名手机应用开发者，应该对友盟之类的统计SDK有所了解。如今这些第三方统计平台越来越吃香，因为各大厂商平台能利用这些数据做的事情，太多了。</p>\n<p>最常见的，就是很多平台引以为荣的<strong>推荐系统</strong>。</p>\n"},{"route":"/blog/viewpager-fragment-lazyload/","title":"ViewPager配合Fragment懒加载的一个坑","categories":[{"name":"开发","id":"3ff3c3"}],"tags":[{"name":"Android","className":"vp-tag-color-17"}],"date":"2018-05-16","words":247,"readingTime":{"words":"约 247 字","time":"小于 1 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":""},{"route":"/blog/hexo-github-jianzhanji/","title":"hexo与github建站记","categories":[{"name":"骚灵","id":"badc57"}],"tags":[{"name":"hexo","className":"vp-tag-color-4"}],"date":"2018-05-11","words":1260,"readingTime":{"words":"约 1260 字","time":"大约 4 分钟"},"draft":false,"encrypt":false,"excerpt":"<p>前一段时间Google开放了.app的域名申请，当时我搜了一下自己想要的一个域名，但是感觉有点小贵就没下手，没想到过了几天这个域名就没了。所以火急火燎的买了现在这个域名，但是一时间没想好要干嘛，思来想去的不如就建个小博客站吧。</p>\n"}]}}